# ── Required: Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Without these the app cannot start — src/lib/supabase.ts reads them at module
# load. Find both under Supabase → Project Settings → API. The anon key is a
# public, row-level-security-scoped key and is safe in the browser bundle.
#
# Apply docs/supabase-schema.sql to the project once before the first cohort.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# ── Optional: the live AI ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Powers the Apex Mentor, the simulated counterpart, the debrief coach, and
# scoring. Set it in your Vercel project settings (never commit it). Without a
# key every endpoint degrades to scripted responses, so the app still runs end
# to end — it just can't grade anything.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional model override; defaults to claude-opus-5 (see api/_model.ts).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
